{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_title", "source_sha256": "cea00d282488294e16582436474b38e92c520ce5830093c07f145f0b61457d6f", "ja": "笑顔のなかで", "zh": "在笑容之中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e862bd8587aef031c162561b5d0c6c977aadc86e13d5e7549b98b36e2b918d1a", "ja": "センターを任された美奈子は、自分のこと\nそっちのけでメンバーのフォローを続け、\n場を盛り上げる。彼女のリラックス方法は\nいつも通りの、みんなへのお世話だった。\n育まれた温かい絆で、ステージは成功する。", "zh": "被选为Center的美奈子，\n总是将自己的事放在一旁，\n以协助团员为优先，让现场气氛热络起来。\n她放松的方法，就是一如既往地照顾大家。\n在彼此累积的深厚羁绊下，表演圆满落幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3d764b538f0d1242e7be8c405cb09a11cdc2fbf2c45a149e66b0736a9eb149fe", "ja": "（次のライブ、センターは美奈子に決まった。\nその美奈子は……レッスン中か）", "zh": "（下次演唱会的Center决定由美奈子来担任了。\n说到美奈子……正在练习啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "ce2181be3f9d636b9f3f19cb916a94b9ed19a7e95977b4426b95629ae26752ae", "ja": "う～ん、どうしたらいいんだろか。", "zh": "嗯～该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "29849ecd9f64af8e2fc9f5973d74fd81bddc521a7a0c7b2fe5e1eb170b7d6a95", "ja": "ここを、こうかな？\nそれとも……うう、むずかしいね。", "zh": "这边应该是这样？\n还是说……唔唔，好难喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "7b61bc672978ee848039d08d17fccf67ac3ae585a85ed6fef3e85745087a287c", "ja": "育ちゃん、ひなたちゃん、どうかしたの？", "zh": "小育、日向，有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "865509651946278d91b33d1d2e6b580de8a5664e4b01505b701999dec6c80944", "ja": "美奈子さん。今度の公演の振り付けなんだけども、\nわからないところがあるべさ。", "zh": "美奈子，就是这次公演的舞步，\n我有些地方不太懂该怎么跳哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "76fc483807b1fea19218eee20b12709f6cf101170e64926345060e3622a516b9", "ja": "どこの部分かな？", "zh": "哪个部分？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "fea8844664886cf052a9dc9dcb5b4ddd46119b04a77beb0426f781b691c17a8b", "ja": "サビに入るちょっと前ぐらい……。\nここでどうしても、わからなくなっちゃうんだ。", "zh": "在快进入副歌之前……\n这边不管怎么练，我就是弄不懂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "fd1c4acb8aa66715ead50eac7ebd2c37109417e751b2b16c69a3f93f4a9fbac1", "ja": "あそこか～。\n細かい動きが入るから、難しいよね。", "zh": "那里啊～\n有很多细微的动作，所以很难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "ae96ed4353135a191232f106dcf68610919e7dbaaace8dcda82c0cd310c2a2c2", "ja": "もうすぐ本番なのに、覚えられなかったら……。\n美奈子さんに、迷惑をかけてしまうべさ。", "zh": "就快要正式表演了，要是不赶快记住……\n会给美奈子添麻烦的哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "59605c446c0ca7312d64bfbc7256aeac974792c563f6d3d3081e95a1f34c307e", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、育ちゃん……。\n私のこと気にしてくれて、ありがとう！", "zh": "日向、小育……\n谢谢你们这么替我着想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "02c3592e2bc887c5aa0edffdcb2dbcec2ea8bdd0c8f690b2b04b3cee9feb7dbc", "ja": "でも、そんなに力まないでも大丈夫！\n確かに、センターは私だけど……。", "zh": "不过，你们压力不需要那么大！\n虽然Center是我没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "78143f55d93e178fa7f4a32e039fcb9ef2898e75db4ce384caea2addce234d50", "ja": "ライブはみんなで作るものなんだから、\nみんなで、できるようにすればいいんだよ！", "zh": "但演唱会是由大家一起打造的，\n所以大家一起学习就好了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "8e984762681878172476c3a8b40653128df90cd3abc2f8af793c6b0dda096301", "ja": "美奈子さん……。", "zh": "美奈子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "8e79fdf2e8000cc42ada1b611d5f9ab16d009021224e6b4336ae791f74785ab9", "ja": "だから、できないところの振り付けは、\nこれから一緒に練習しよう？　ね♪", "zh": "所以我们一起来练习还跳不好的舞步吧，好吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "a0eb176b493688684308007205f1b0de90eb6d1607d9d74b6da70e433e2c61fb", "ja": "うん……ありがとねぇ、美奈子さん。\nお言葉に甘えて、よろしく頼むねぇ。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你呢～美奈子。\n那就照你说的，麻烦你啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "d1a8776f66b356b793d3f683be466b7bc9f91432c9aa8ba7c5b62a6320f57ba6", "ja": "わたしも！　わたしも、一緒にやりたい！\n美奈子さん、いいでしょ？", "zh": "还有我！我也想一起练习！\n可以吧，美奈子姊姊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "afa16dce53c9156ed2977be49789ca485ad22b47cd80f413c438b18a81196dd8", "ja": "もちろんだよ♪\nそれじゃあ、みんなでやってみよう～！", "zh": "当然可以♪\n那就大家一起跳跳看吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d05565760d371a05a648ae82a3a1376c6918ba17c4f20d9774f044a4576e7fd9", "ja": "(センターらしく、みんなを引っ張っている……。\nやっぱり美奈子に任せてよかったな)", "zh": "（美奈子引领大家的模样很有很有Center风范……\n交给她果然是对的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "1dd271cd471a5fd0d28c0f8afe2d6bd45d562fd41f4ba7d1dd4e98b52d0110dd", "ja": "1、2、3、4、最後に……んしょ！", "zh": "1、2、3、4、最后……嘿咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "3f81ef8d617a81e2998686d78a187f97beeca62bb499e54e530306646c1870b8", "ja": "あ、あれ……？　あたし、今……。", "zh": "咦，奇怪……？我刚刚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "20bef0241a8b27db3376d9ea7ade8a0a298b5b67ccf244cc4fce247fa9f9c574", "ja": "わぁ、すごいすごい！\nひなたちゃん、さっきの振り付けできてたよ！", "zh": "哇，好棒、好棒！\n小日会跳刚刚的舞步了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "9206d60de96feff590379482f2559a809667864806b7794e8fb471a007d183f8", "ja": "わっほ～い！　やったね！", "zh": "哇哦～！成功了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "b481758051e2ade253bb73a2061ff3406e9024238e8fb8bc08fb665114040f9f", "ja": "えへへ……。美奈子さん、育ちゃん、ありがとねえ。\nふたりのおかげだよぉ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……美奈子、小育，谢谢你们呢～\n这都要感谢你们的帮忙唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "89674e57ebe96efb08111629b9a073acd5439a1dc51cc686e8d3c33ab5d4087a", "ja": "ううん、私は何んにもしてないよ！　ひなたちゃんが\n一生懸命頑張ったから、できるようになったんだよ♪", "zh": "别这么说，我什么都没做喔！\n是因为日向拚命练习，才有办法学会啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "f48d30523739a4b19419390477d4eddf973b6df72659b92d60ca7bb8425978d0", "ja": "でも、あたしひとりだったら、\nきっとうまくいかなかったと思うべさ。", "zh": "可是，如果只有我一个人，\n肯定不会这么顺利哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "d0a4cf084ec4794e9a6c37a1006c7c6a8290a12f823420126560ffdae5bd992e", "ja": "美奈子さんって、教え方すごく上手なんだね！\nわたしも、前より上手になっちゃった！", "zh": "美奈子姊姊很会教人呢！\n我也跳得比之前更好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "35c5aa985bd1a1e1beca0a6a8c1e151f487623e777706a0f039b14a4b74965e6", "ja": "本当だねぇ。美奈子さんの教え方、\nすごくわかりやすかったよぉ。ありがとねぇ。", "zh": "真的呢，美奈子的教法很好懂喔。\n谢谢你呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "89113cca770b789075a14e50d9dbbd7d3742bbabf65e290c58c97e2be9d003b9", "ja": "え、えへへ、そうかな……？　それじゃあ\n今の感じを忘れないうちに、もう1回踊ってみようか！", "zh": "嘿、嘿嘿，是这样吗……？\n那，趁感觉还没忘记之前，我们再跳一次吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1029_030iku", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "d826a93f9b5c938e08cabf2570632abd148f35a5fcff6c3939f8e86ea9497daf", "ja": "らんらんらぁ～ん♪　ららら～♪", "zh": "啦啦啦～♪啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "4fffa42d84b74845c83fe937d58785953a890cad2b87753fd4b30bb02e52f030", "ja": "あれ、この声……。", "zh": "咦，这个歌声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "2dd271688fee009dcef448a6627648a580b36f7dc01dcf2b27f27f884f6baf88", "ja": "ら～ららら～♪　らんらんらぁ～ん♪\nらんららぁ～ん♪　よ、ほ、えいっ！", "zh": "啦～啦啦啦～♪啦啦啦～♪\n啦啦啦～♪哟、喝、嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "6e8ce561cb8d4bedbfe53754ee9d2fe12576b8c0d940f3b76852524e09ebb713", "ja": "や、やったー！？\nわーい、上手くできた！　ばんざ～い♪", "zh": "成、成功了──！？\n哇～唱得很好呢！万岁～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "126fc03a75bc139cc360212579961bf838f3e95239ee4a0d7d947b735224b42e", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、お疲れさま。\nごきげんだね、何かいいことあったの？", "zh": "可奈，辛苦啰。\n你看起来心情很好呢，遇到什么好事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "25a64c0c18752209bc159459a437f859437192169400b6b3829098de301d6e50", "ja": "あ、美奈子さん！", "zh": "啊，美奈子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "ceba33322d8fc3633f2a71eac92e9448399b431d70a9bde0c444e49201e59a58", "ja": "実はですね……今度の公演の私のパート、\n初めて最初から最後まで、歌えたんですよ～！", "zh": "其实啊……这是我第一次把\n下次公演我负责的部分成功从头唱到尾呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1038_019min", "source_sha256": "86e4a648519c29e4a4b7c73b94f525631c86ad1994eb486ec0f88a9def3cdf5c", "ja": "わあ～！　やったね、可奈ちゃん！", "zh": "哇～！那真是太好了呢，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "632ad69c8c0546d11b041d6992456600412372b5fb440fee45e206c8b95d9bbd", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます！　今回ちょっと\n難しかったんですけど、やっと覚えられました♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你！\n这次难度比较高，但我终于记起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1040_030iku", "source_sha256": "3bc30794dbe93e24779edd63a3349bfffa5178867d30fd209b50814a5c1a69f1", "ja": "あ、あのね、可奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "那、那个，可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "e8711b512a0942d9f775b0d6e8ff159f894f5a8fab82c428b9774ee0aaf58505", "ja": "なーに、育ちゃん？", "zh": "怎么了，小育？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1042_030iku", "source_sha256": "bff696e0413daae995aeac5b6a704a49919ef7526acd770a04fbd0c193e43267", "ja": "今、可奈ちゃんが歌ってたところ……\nわたしのパートだよ？", "zh": "可奈刚刚唱的……\n是我负责的部分喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "9e6e063fee0fb2b505e4927934a82e01dcd42d97c2d8839de5249644d1ef87cc", "ja": "え…………えぇー！！！\nそれ、本当ぉ～！？", "zh": "咦…………咦咦──！！！\n你说的是真的吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "9811d46d09c8e2a306625c4c2269e6906d554e945328984b65bc54d18fa7de43", "ja": "う、うん……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1045_035hin", "source_sha256": "505bbc77cdb4ddfac004a4fed86a1beee6697779f55cf62b125cdd6be8553249", "ja": "ありゃあ……。可奈ちゃん、\n間違えて覚えてしまったんだねぇ。", "zh": "哎呀……可奈，\n你记错负责的部分了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "24c131fecf811c11f8ac018652db8abbbac55e3c30f0cf8295f3294dd02a92e6", "ja": "そ、そんなぁ……。\nやっと覚えられたと思ったのに……うぅ……。", "zh": "怎、怎么会这样……\n我好不容易才记起来的……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "6241d45a754d253c304a9b372ed50092c965bbb1615e5f4e343195556a441de8", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、大丈夫！\n違うパートだったけど、ちゃんと覚えられたんでしょ？", "zh": "可奈，不要难过！\n虽然记错，但你还是好好记住了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1048_019min", "source_sha256": "be66b92246dcca58ef850e8660ff910d51798553c067f82022fb7fd5917c050f", "ja": "それなら、自分のパートも絶対覚えられるよ！\nさっきの歌とは違うところ、ってだけだもん♪", "zh": "既然这样，你也一定能记住自己的部分！\n只要再多记另外一段就好了啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "3c7bec9a4c434af261b924cb94a900b34dbf7c039fd1539a37e080ed5ae3bb29", "ja": "あ、そっか……そうですね！\nそれなら、覚えられるかも？", "zh": "啊，对耶……说得也是！\n这样我说不定记得住喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1050_036kan", "source_sha256": "c219073935b6d6a15edfbb3877ef1e28bd31bcf669dc854d07fe4569e8b618c0", "ja": "ありがとうございます、美奈子さん！\nなんか、すごくやる気が湧いてきました♪", "zh": "谢谢你，美奈子！\n总觉得又有满满的干劲了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1051_036kan", "source_sha256": "03f87618cbafc932f69253879a40ca7190686bd38b98ff9598236727a97020ef", "ja": "可奈～練習頑張るぞ～♪\n苦手なダンスも～克服するぞ～♪　おー！", "zh": "可奈～会努力练习～♪\n连不擅长的舞蹈～都会克服的～♪喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1052_019min", "source_sha256": "cf044032f86ccc7c08f467b133f5f5a52329c18485a2468e0273959f128e28a3", "ja": "うん、頑張れ！\n私も応援してるよ～！　お～！", "zh": "嗯，加油！\n我也会帮忙的～！喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1053_p", "source_sha256": "5818a154ebc7887c783741ee72ed8f8927eb3c609178ca4617f2508c37e12aa5", "ja": "（美奈子のおかげで、\nレッスン室の空気が活気づいてきてるな）", "zh": "（多亏有美奈子在，\n练习室里充满活力呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1054_p", "source_sha256": "baf0db3656c590cb65a8b88bedcf813a866f29b6710aebff9cb9c9ac72451255", "ja": "（でも、さっきからみんなの面倒ばかり\nみてるような……自分の練習は大丈夫なのか？）", "zh": "（不过，她好像从刚刚就一直在照顾大家……\n不知道她自己练习得顺不顺利？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1055_019min", "source_sha256": "2ccd082089807ce67f2eb3553da72990e653b52948d018e9d6cf8a9c248b23db", "ja": "よ～し！\nそれじゃあ、私達もレッスンを再開しよ～！", "zh": "好～！\n那我们也继续练习吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1056_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1057_035hin", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1058_p", "source_sha256": "2cfe244154f4e38825562a1d26353a45dc81e5ceb6e12a633c5b08fadec163c0", "ja": "（休憩に入ったら、一度声をかけてみるか……）", "zh": "（等大家开始休息，再问她看看吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1059_035hin", "source_sha256": "ad92e20ef2251c1fc777975898464dc1a8d8e528e7bbae80fe761b2595fdb3d2", "ja": "ふぅ、ふぅ。いっぱい踊ったねえ。\nあたし、ちょっこし疲れちゃったべさ。", "zh": "呼、呼，跳了好久呢～\n我有些累了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1060_030iku", "source_sha256": "6ca9317a4844c7bc77e9a27ccd0328c84d208198ced3ac321a62c0124312f018", "ja": "わたしも、つかれちゃった！\nでもみんなでおどるの、すごく楽しかったよ！", "zh": "我也累了！\n不过和大家一起跳舞好开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1061_019min", "source_sha256": "03f3634ea59b55ed7e0d943f6c60e043f41d0436b2f7fc83fd6ac23ef3d58ec1", "ja": "育ちゃんもひなたちゃんも、これで完璧だね！\nよかった～♪", "zh": "小育和日向这样就没问题了！\n太好啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1062_030iku", "source_sha256": "7d9567450444b2482e55cbec0a33a63cee30de4be4ed88875e9ff2010eb0824c", "ja": "うん！\nでもわたし、ちょっとノドかわいちゃったかも……。", "zh": "嗯！\n不过我觉得好像有点口渴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1063_035hin", "source_sha256": "6991c07b60d477acdb6f23fbaff2112b39b4f749ba1fd4ea1e383c3a3f63a3eb", "ja": "なら、今日はあたしと育ちゃんで買いに行くべさ。\nこの前は、美奈子さんが買ってきてくれたからねぇ。", "zh": "那今天就让我和小育去买喝的吧。\n因为之前是美奈子帮我们买的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1064_030iku", "source_sha256": "3a442f46401898c6b19234fdab5081ccbbc4d7fda13905ea9bc645b28ee8f574", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、行こう！\n美奈子さん、ちょっと待っててね！", "zh": "小日，走吧！\n美奈子姊姊，你等我们一下喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1065_019min", "source_sha256": "ec7ebb5a5c27769a7f65c3ca8ed1d96d602f05d8aa9f0146738a7933d8e5c124", "ja": "あ、ふたりとも転ばないようにね～！\n……もう、気を遣わなくていいのに。ふふっ♪", "zh": "啊，你们两个小心不要跌倒喔～！\n……真是的，明明不用跟我那么客气。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_1066", "source_sha256": "10238f52102fdd5cf5c02a2012f4a58420f4ca25a1ce1a3c4ad9f7f5e64b3ba8", "ja": "声をかける", "zh": "开口搭话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b7729672c374fe0cef1aa4c1d584a8a8bd2c968673a898b6e3a18ae5c9917b70", "ja": "美奈子、お疲れさま！", "zh": "美奈子，辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2001_019min", "source_sha256": "55771efe2e40d36abb1400a4264b6b911798bf44efde4de0713a695728259bdc", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです。何か、用事ですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！你辛苦了。\n有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2002_p", "source_sha256": "44c98b4efd716cf1a7a690e7b018b7bd3d573c355876564a46c07fb5f2c02c03", "ja": "用ってほどのことでもないんだけど、\nちょっと聞きたいことがあって……。", "zh": "也不算有什么事，\n只是有点事情想问你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2003_019min", "source_sha256": "c5e9be108e483c979024b2f6c6e4c8456aa559ef994981878ef034d2df21d8b5", "ja": "はい、なんでしょう？\nあっ……もしかして、お腹が空いちゃいましたか？", "zh": "是，怎么了吗？\n啊……难道说，你肚子饿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2004_019min", "source_sha256": "951b7fbbb89ef1debcdd18f6b0c8b0b00fe34ba861ded06c81471cc0513c9656", "ja": "ダメですよ～、忙しいからってお昼抜いたりしちゃ。\n今すぐ何か作りますから、待っててくださいね！", "zh": "这样不行啦～就算很忙，也不能不吃午餐。\n我现在马上去帮你做点吃的，等我一下喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2005_p", "source_sha256": "3b4ba36b7b9da9919cae3461d49dda4a494432f20f793c0bcf61da0e63ae3a60", "ja": "違う違う、そうじゃなくて。美奈子、さっきの\nレッスンの間、ずっとみんなの面倒を見てただろ？", "zh": "不是的，我不是肚子饿。\n美奈子，刚刚练习时，你一直在照顾大家吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2006_p", "source_sha256": "ed7464713a5e770bb7c7842460a926d0c66f69ed4eed876e27de88dc54bdeacb", "ja": "自分の練習は、大丈夫なのかと思ってな。", "zh": "我只是在想，不知道你自己练习得顺不顺利？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2007_019min", "source_sha256": "5dafe504de38eb101f127cb1244414a61ee3aab06deea41e688713c29ce20e21", "ja": "なるほど～、そういうことでしたか。\nはい、大丈夫ですよ！", "zh": "原来如此～是要问我这件事啊。\n是，很顺利喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2008_019min", "source_sha256": "0f4be06efdafb1eba1bfe7986422cdc96d9101d24aa13fe3ee4312dad1c713f7", "ja": "確かに、初めてのセンターですから。\nプレッシャーはありますけど……。", "zh": "说实话，因为这是我第一次当Center，\n多少会觉得有压力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2009_019min", "source_sha256": "273c0defc40aef1964b57d98f3328ff5ad3e365edf992e4eb9739ef9c4ab069f", "ja": "でも、だからこそ……いつもどおりに\n誰かのお世話をしてる方が、落ち着くんです♪", "zh": "但也因为这样……\n像平常那样照顾别人，会让我觉得比较放松♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2010_p", "source_sha256": "fa6314284bd54b6302bd8aac9e0979ad5e2a90c436ea14781f675dbb632c888a", "ja": "そうか……ならいいんだ。安心したよ。", "zh": "是吗……那就好，这样我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2011_019min", "source_sha256": "4b9c611e7f4e333b04ff9328f83d714cc704ebaaa77abe75471cbf6e3ca3ea16", "ja": "あ……。もしかして私、{$P$}さんに\n心配かけちゃってました？", "zh": "啊……难道说，\n我让{$P$}先生担心了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_2012", "source_sha256": "2f718d5390d3ceea2345a0a02c444e3a7621e3794c110c4dc70da7e76caa728c", "ja": "そうだな", "zh": "是啊", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3000_p", "source_sha256": "c9cae15728510c5f55e5b493070c2cdf6aca22485e1afa78d3c93494d0f7ca0a", "ja": "そうだな……。ちっとも心配させてくれないから、\n心配してたんだ。", "zh": "是啊……因为你一点也不需要我操心，\n我才会特别担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3001_019min", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3002_p", "source_sha256": "510d08c6f950cf184703a82e622f6bed4aaf7e1c65819a5fde4c013ab48a247f", "ja": "みんなの世話をして落ち着くなら、それでいい。\nでもひとつだけ、忘れないでくれ。", "zh": "如果你觉得照顾大家可以让心情比较放松，\n就照你的意思做吧。不过有件事，希望你不要忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3003_p", "source_sha256": "3971facf4e7e39b8c1affa196858ccb0780a40f70c753d638ba53b9efc030f6b", "ja": "全部のことを美奈子ができなくても大丈夫。\n美奈子の世話は、ちゃんと俺が焼くから。", "zh": "你不需要把所有的事都揽在自己身上。\n美奈子就由我来好好照顾吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3005_p", "source_sha256": "a9440bc7f6078f534eb9d3c940eca194c86384f9d50672a211dc3607c74bd7b5", "ja": "ま、俺にできることなんて、\nたいしたことないんだけどな？", "zh": "只不过，我能做的都是些\n微不足道的小事而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3006_019min", "source_sha256": "c2614b1131c696b8234d35e2065b126864fdf04b170126145e8cb67049a21004", "ja": "そ、そんなこと……全然ないって思います。", "zh": "别、别这么说……完全没有这回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3007_019min", "source_sha256": "e68960ab0ad34352d716e5f3ecbc03e6dfcebd200ca576999f1e415b3c0eaf48", "ja": "今だって、こんなに……\n力をくれちゃったりして。えへへ♪", "zh": "像现在……\n你也给了我很多力量喔，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3008_019min", "source_sha256": "0181a6f874e4f9c8802c81920671630456e92c4135097e9605e373035b7018dc", "ja": "って、あれ？", "zh": "咦，奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3009_019min", "source_sha256": "14a6d8bad5662f0d516ede71c015286d8d85813d708f774037ba216e7bd23f39", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n上着の袖口、なんだかほつれちゃってますよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n你上衣的袖口，好像脱线了喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3010_p", "source_sha256": "752437143d2f31633240d5f71fa43aa61d4690d9ebf98885cdfc42cf2d4cf988", "ja": "ん？　あ、ほんとだ……。", "zh": "嗯？啊，真的耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3011_019min", "source_sha256": "1f172d2fc3c44e0684d89bcad063cb4c441d915f66577e46418a25d6997c8c3f", "ja": "引っ掛けちゃったら大変です。\n私がパパッと縫っちゃいますから、脱いでください！", "zh": "要是勾到东西就不好了。\n我一下子就可以缝好，脱下来给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3012_p", "source_sha256": "c6d8aad8f0af91c0cf9d82dbc259b601e1a2aa1da5cc5e32e6e64cba4ae697ee", "ja": "い、いや。\n後でやっておくから大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "不、不用了。\n我等等会处理，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3013_019min", "source_sha256": "ac9884ef0c6b6798970ca82f03b7f30b6e584e7b537951af5ed1b9fc5b8446c9", "ja": "いえいえ、遠慮しないでください！\nささ、早く脱いで……。", "zh": "别这么说，请不用跟我客气！\n来，快点脱下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3014_030iku", "source_sha256": "f1ef1ff5f0307437080599a476cfb8335d894889a9b9814a2d7808cc32cf875d", "ja": "美奈子さん、ただいま～！\nジュース、買ってきたよ！", "zh": "美奈子姊姊，我们回来了～！\n我们买了果汁喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3015_030iku", "source_sha256": "6bcca46813288e51fa845d6cb840afc72843fb34d4592946b5fa10402d87f1cc", "ja": "あれ？　{$P$}さんの\n上着なんか持って、何してるの？", "zh": "咦？你拿着{$P$}先生的上衣，\n在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
