{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3017_019min", "source_sha256": "578b37adb2d7419692481dc64b7d3f97ee7a3700923e54b872e20fe05b3edae1", "ja": "そ、そうかな～？　えへへ……。\nそんなこと、ないと思うんだけど……♪", "zh": "会、会吗～？嘿嘿……\n我觉得还好啦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3018_030iku", "source_sha256": "09b83a7c0d0299f2f89da0db6faf5d9d0afe7637f18b070eaa79e5d805563c10", "ja": "うん！　仲よし、いいなぁ……。", "zh": "嗯！真羡慕你们感情这么好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_008_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_008_3019_019min", "source_sha256": "adac229ecf71e1898625a18025fa893d80103695de6464be9e044af4ba631e25", "ja": "縫い物も終わったし……ふたりとも、おいで～！\n一緒に仲よしさんしよう♪", "zh": "既然衣服也缝好了……你们两个过来吧～！\n大家要相亲相爱喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
